.env
*.key

# Street View imagery ---------------------------------------------------
# Not committed on purpose: Google Maps Platform terms do not permit
# redistributing Street View content. direct/data/manifest_*.jsonl carries the
# pano ids, so `python direct/refetch_images.py` rebuilds the exact benchmark
# from your own API key.
streetview/

